{
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Cell \u2014 chunks + handtuned vision-scent DA scaffold (v5.3 Phase C)",
    "description": "Phase v5.3 Phase C \u2014 handtuned reward scaffold.  Inherits Phase B's intent-chunk pipeline and adds an explicit teaching signal so the substrate has a goal-aligned reward density that random chunks alone don't provide.\n\nDataflow on top of Phase B:\n  body publishes reality.proprio.green_fraction every tick (count of food-saturated pixels / total raycast pixels).\n  reflex_green_visible (DualEMADetector) emits events.green_visible when green_fraction's short EMA exceeds long EMA \u00d7 ratio_threshold (gradient rising \u2014 agent is approaching food visually).\n  reflex_scent_hit (existing) emits events.hit when scent gradient is rising AND moving forward.\n  event_conj_scent_green (EventConjunction) ANDs both events within a 30-tick (~500ms) window; emits events.scent_aligned_with_green.\n  neuro recognises this event and pulses dopamine by da_aligned_gain (default 0.7 \u2014 larger than da_hit_gain because this is an explicit teaching signal, not a hit).\n\nThe DA pulse propagates into Premotor's REINFORCE update.  Intents that the brain was choosing during the aligned-event tick get credited even though no actual hit fired yet.  Chunks crystallised around aligned moments inherit the goal-relevance via their intent sequences, so dispatched chunks should bias toward food-approach behaviours.\n\nA/B (architecture-capable gate) vs the_cell_chunks.json (Phase B, no scaffold).  \u0394 \u2265 +2 hits at p<0.05 OR \u0394 \u2265 +1 at p<0.30 confirmed by n=30 follow-up = substrate IS architecture-capable for chemotaxis when given the reward signal explicitly.  Null = substrate's representation can't support chemotaxis even with explicit reward, deeper bottleneck downstream.\n\n2026-05-10 update: NT signal narrowed to brain-relevant senses only \u2014 whisker_ht_rate=0, wall_stuck_*_drain=0; pulse decay slowed (0.97) for clearer reward landscape.  Justified by paired-seed A/B vs prior wider-NT baseline: \u0394=+0.5, p=0.063, 95% CI [0.00, +1.00] \u2014 3 seeds improved, 7 unchanged, 0 regressed.",
    "env_target": "cell",
    "phase_tag": "v5.3-handtuned",
    "reflex_modular": true,
    "body_model": "differential_paddler",
    "episode_length": 3600
  },
  "version": 1,
  "runtime": {
    "thread_pool": "per_instance",
    "num_threads": 0
  },
  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "neuro",
      "type": "NeurochemState",
      "params": {
        "da_baseline": 0.2,
        "ht_baseline": 0.65,
        "da_decay": 0.97,
        "ht_decay": 0.97,
        "intrinsic_da_gain": 0.05,
        "scent_da_rate": 0.25,
        "travel_da_rate": 0.02,
        "whisker_ht_rate": 0.0,
        "hunger_ht_rate": 0.01,
        "event_coupled_da": true,
        "event_coupled_ht": true,
        "da_baseline_ema_alpha": 0.001,
        "da_aligned_gain": 0.7,
        "aligned_event_name": "scent_aligned_with_green",
        "wall_stuck_da_drain": 0.0,
        "wall_stuck_ht_drain": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "epm_imu",
      "type": "EPM",
      "params": {
        "modality_group": "kinematic",
        "modality_name": "imu",
        "encoder_kind": "rbf",
        "input_topic": "reality.proprio.imu",
        "projection_dim": 32,
        "proprio_state_dims": 4,
        "baking_threshold": 50,
        "min_insertion_error": 0.02,
        "predicted_pathway_steps": 3,
        "subtract_descending_prediction": true
